      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "P002 explicitly supplies the hypothesis and its epistemic limit; P001 identifies the discrepancy being explained."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C003.signal_basis",
    "value": "Independent agreement about a booking's return timing can support that equipment arrived after the next scheduled start. Supported patterns are compared across late and timely bookings, while corroborated timing alone does not establish the cause of lateness.",
    "scope": "Evidence relevant to delayed returns as a competing explanation, limited to corroborated timing and comparisons across bookings.",
